      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<section class=\"sr-journal sr-handout\"><p class=\"sr-eyebrow\">STILLROOT'S SONG &nbsp; | &nbsp; PLAYER HANDOUT</p><h1>Keep one end fixed</h1>\n<p>The passage can put the door somewhere else. It cannot make a continuous length of thread become two separate lengths without cutting it.</p>\n<p>Do not follow the voice. Follow what is in your hand.</p>\n<p>At the loom I counted three cords. One carried names. One moved like a serpent. One breathed.</p>\n<p>The fourth did nothing until the others answered.</p>\n<p>Nella has asked for her cuff back. I will give her the coat, not the book.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Sella</li>\n</ul>\n</section>"
